  "decision": "Do not add generic cancellation/exception infrastructure to this minimal patch. New quiet wait has a genuine cancellation limitation, but no supported application cancellation path was found; stock synchronizer wait already lacks cancellation cleanup. Earlier startup acquisition adds no throwing allocation or condition-wait call in the audited RAM path.",
